{"4326820": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Rolling Stock", "steam_appid": 4326820, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4976900], "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Summary</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rolling Stock is an online co-op train loading game for up to 4 players. Handle various types of cargo, ensure a tight fit, and help your friends when things get heavy. This new fully physics-based puzzler is rolling out cross-platform on Windows and Linux!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Cargo Tetris</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each train contains a new job for you to complete. Every request becomes more complex, so put on your thinking hats to Tetris the cargo together in the most optimal way.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Pull Together Now</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lift, rotate, throw and drag all kinds of cargo. Everyone's input matters so remember, many hands make light work, as long as you are pulling in the same direction.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Custom Orders</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No two requests are the same, handle all kinds of oddities in unconventional form factors. Your employers expect only the best from you, Yardmaster.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Developed Responsibly</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Made with love using open source tooling and absolutely no generative AI.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Summary</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rolling Stock is an online co-op train loading game for up to 4 players. Handle various types of cargo, ensure a tight fit, and help your friends when things get heavy. This new fully physics-based puzzler is rolling out cross-platform on Windows and Linux!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Cargo Tetris</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each train contains a new job for you to complete. Every request becomes more complex, so put on your thinking hats to Tetris the cargo together in the most optimal way.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Pull Together Now</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lift, rotate, throw and drag all kinds of cargo. Everyone's input matters so remember, many hands make light work, as long as you are pulling in the same direction.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Custom Orders</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No two requests are the same, handle all kinds of oddities in unconventional form factors. Your employers expect only the best from you, Yardmaster.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Developed Responsibly</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Made with love using open source tooling and absolutely no generative AI.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "An online co-op train loading game for up to 4 players. Handle various types of cargo, ensure a tight fit, and help your friends when things get heavy. This new fully physics-based puzzler is rolling out cross-platform on Windows and Linux!", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Danish, Dutch, Finnish, Japanese, Polish, Portuguese - Portugal, Romanian, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Korean, Ukrainian", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4326820/78947fd38693aa16b42a9cc187313b077856d6e3/header.jpg?t=1788188477", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4326820/a370433b741bcf7e43f4b7f00a6534e4e2032d6b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788188477", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4326820/a370433b741bcf7e43f4b7f00a6534e4e2032d6b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1788188477", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 or above<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> i5 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia RTX 2080 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<